#: image-seo-pro.php
msgid "https://github.com/dyzlek/image-seo-pro"
msgstr "https://github.com/dyzlek/image-seo-pro"

#. Description of the plugin
#: image-seo-pro.php
msgid "Lighter images (WebP / AVIF, originals never modified) and complete alt texts, with AI suggestions."
msgstr "Des images plus légères (WebP / AVIF, sans jamais modifier les originaux) et des textes alternatifs complets, avec suggestions par IA."

